limit.description:
The number of results per page. Valid range is 1-100.

This parameter defines the size of each pagination chunk. Values outside 1-100 will be rejected.

Business requirement: Maximum limit of 100 to prevent excessive memory usage on the server and ensure responsive API responses.

If not provided, defaults to 20. The default is chosen to balance between reducing HTTP requests and not overwhelming clients with too much data at once.

@minimum 1
@maximum 100
